==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[post-humous]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|posthumus|lang=la}}, a variant spelling of {{term|postumus|lang=la}}, superlative form of {{term|posterus|lang=la}} ("coming after"), the "h" added by association with {{term|lang=la|humus}} ("ground, earth") referring to burial.

